# Chuan hoa xuong dong va phan loai binary.
#
# Vi sao can: `core.autocrlf=true` la mac dinh tren nhieu may Windows trong nhom.
# Khong co file nay, git tu doan text/binary bang heuristic, va moi lan checkout
# co the doi byte cua file — lam sai checksum trong `*.sha256` va lam ban diff.
# Toan bo 759 file text trong repo hien da la LF (do 2026-08-15), nen cac rule
# duoi day chi *khoa* trang thai dang co, khong sinh ra thay doi noi dung nao.

# Mac dinh: file nao git nhan la text thi luu LF trong repo.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Khai bao tuong minh cho cac duoi quan trong, de khong phu thuoc heuristic.
*.py     text eol=lf
*.json   text eol=lf
*.jsonl  text eol=lf
*.md     text eol=lf
*.ps1    text eol=lf
*.sha256 text eol=lf

# Binary: khong bao gio doi xuong dong, khong bao gio merge theo dong.
# `.wav` la quan trong nhat — 149 file dataset audio cua SPIKE-001, checksum
# cua chung nam trong eval/datasets va bao cao evidence.
*.wav    binary
# Asset che do demo offline (issue #176): nhac CC BY va anh nen ban do.
# Phai co truoc file nhi phan DAU TIEN — them sau thi git da kip doan sai
# va lam hong file tren may `core.autocrlf=true`, y het bay ma `.wav` da dinh.
*.mp3    binary
*.webp   binary
*.png    binary
*.jpg    binary
*.jpeg   binary
*.ico    binary
*.bin    binary
# Bang test ghep lenh (docs/kich_ban_test_ghep_lenh.xlsx) — zip, hong ngay neu
# `* text=auto eol=lf` doi CRLF ben trong.
*.xlsx   binary

# Ngoai le, phai dat SAU cac rule tren de thang:
# manifest.json dung CRLF tu nguon; giu nguyen byte de checksum trong
# VF9_2026_vi/corpus.sha256 con dung sau khi checkout tren may khac.
VF9_2026_vi/manifest.json -text
